{:edb/db-before-t 316 :edb/db-after-t 317 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533629 50 #inst "2026-10-04T03:08:34.410Z" 13194139533629 true] [17592186062975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242758 13194139533629 true] [17592186063011 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242766 13194139533629 true] [17592186064065 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242767 13194139533629 true] [17592186064065 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242774 13194139533629 true] [17592186064065 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242823 13194139533629 true] [17592186064065 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242830 13194139533629 true] [17592186064066 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242709 13194139533629 true] [17592186064066 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242781 13194139533629 true] [17592186064066 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242788 13194139533629 true] [17592186064066 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242795 13194139533629 true] [17592186064067 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242716 13194139533629 true] [17592186064067 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242723 13194139533629 true] [17592186064067 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242730 13194139533629 true] [17592186064067 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242802 13194139533629 true] [17592186064067 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242809 13194139533629 true] [17592186064183 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242688 13194139533629 true] [17592186064183 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242695 13194139533629 true] [17592186064183 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242702 13194139533629 true] [17592186064183 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242759 13194139533629 true] [17592186064183 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242816 13194139533629 true] [17592186064184 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242737 13194139533629 true] [17592186064184 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242744 13194139533629 true] [17592186064184 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242751 13194139533629 true] [17592186064184 1020 #edb/ref 17592186242837 13194139533629 true] [17592186064744 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533629 true] [17592186064744 1145 "The function ${U}^{′}(t)$ represents the rate at which the number of users is changing at the moment $t$ hours after launch. \n\nTherefore, ${U}^{′}(4)=650$ means:\n\n$\\,$ *$4$ hours after the launch, the number of users increased at a rate of $650$ users per hour*" 13194139533629 true] [17592186064750 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533629 true] [17592186064750 1145 "The function $A(b)$ gives the area of a rectangle with base $b.$ So\n\n$$\n{A}^{′}(b)=\\frac{\\text{d}A}{\\text{d}b}=\\frac{\\text{Change in }A}{\\text{Change in }b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${A}^{′}(b)$ is the rate at which the area changes as the base changes." 13194139533629 true] [17592186064857 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533629 true] [17592186064857 1145 "The function $N(t)$ gives the number of bacteria inside the dish after $t$ hours. Then,\n\n$$\n{N}^{′}(t)=\\frac{\\text{d}N(t)}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{\\text{Change in }N}{\\text{Change in }t}.\n$$\n\nThus, ${N}^{′}(t)$ gives the rate at which the number of bacteria is increasing at time $t$, which is the same as $r(t).$ Therefore, the relationship between $N(t)$ and $r(t)$ is ${N}^{′}(t)=r(t).$" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1017 #edb/ref 17592186242689 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1089 "q-110037" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1100 "Mary bakes $c$ cupcakes using $f(c)$ grams of flour. What are the units of $\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}c}?$" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1113 #uuid "7e565ca9-f380-5310-8209-2c03b355bc43" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1138 false 13194139533629 true] [17592186242688 1145 "We have that the amount of flour $f(c)$ is measured in grams and the number of cupcakes is measured in cupcakes. \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(c): & \\text{grams} \\\\ c: & \\text{cupcakes}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivative $\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}c}$ measures a change in $f(c)$ over a change in $c.$ So, it represents a ratio of the units:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}c}: & \\frac{\\text{grams}}{\\text{cupcake}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}c}$ is measured in \"grams per cupcake\"." 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242690 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242691 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242692 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242693 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242694 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1041 "selection" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1104 #edb/ref 17592186242691 13194139533629 true] [17592186242689 1110 #uuid "f9da1b1d-2037-5b3f-86ca-ef7a872c24d7" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242690 1034 "squared kilograms per cupcake" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242690 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242690 1111 #uuid "248ff954-3b50-5fd5-a294-d5f37186636b" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242691 1034 "grams per cupcake" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242691 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242691 1111 #uuid "c4c54b0e-1734-5619-8a17-4f81f555d0ab" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242692 1034 "kilograms per cupcake" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242692 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242692 1111 #uuid "963f65ac-5210-5325-a283-dce46558337d" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242693 1034 "cupcakes per kilogram" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242693 1111 #uuid "639d62e7-ab3f-5cf3-abe0-32d898e8be25" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242694 1034 "cupcakes per gram" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242694 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242694 1111 #uuid "58713d47-116e-5375-a164-b935853f9031" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1017 #edb/ref 17592186242696 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1089 "q-110038" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1100 "A dairy farm sells milk on a particular day for $p(v)$ dollars, where $v$ is the number of liters of milk in the dairy farm at the start of the day. What are the units of $\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}v}?$" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1113 #uuid "d881f6ea-8d1b-5e89-b8cd-c39ed4f27281" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1138 false 13194139533629 true] [17592186242695 1145 "We have that the price $p(v)$ is measured in dollars and the volume of milk is measured in liters. \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(v): & \\text{dollars} \\\\ v: & \\text{liters}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivative $\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}v}$ measures a change in $p(v)$ over a change in $v.$ So, it represents a ratio of the units:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}v}: & \\frac{\\text{dollars}}{\\text{liters}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn other words, $\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}v}$ is measured in \"dollars per liter\"." 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242697 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242698 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242699 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242700 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242701 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1041 "selection" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1104 #edb/ref 17592186242697 13194139533629 true] [17592186242696 1110 #uuid "883daeec-8f2f-55d5-802d-de091780489d" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242697 1034 "dollars per liter" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242697 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242697 1111 #uuid "35384093-49f8-5095-975c-6ce2ddcfde41" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242698 1034 "cubic dollars per squared liters" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242698 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533629 true] [17592186242698 1111 #uuid "812be774-ef9e-5fe2-97e3-7f604a3e2bc8" 13194139533629 true] [17592186242699 1034 "milliliters per squared dollar" 13194139533629 true] [175921